     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div>I think this has nothing to do with renderUI : we cannot render the same output at two different places in the app.</div><div>You could put the output outside the tabset, and make its rendering conditional to the value of the active tab.</div></div>"
    ],
